Z||000009||fropuff||08-24-2001||12:00 AM||||I did a pretty complete tune-up last summer, so the air/fuel filters are about a year old.  I hope that the problems are cheap.  BTW: after driving it tonight, I noticed that my acceleration is good from a rolling stop.  Usually, it's the other way around, but not now.  Would a plugged cat make sense?  Might be.  I'm not too worried about my performance now; the Fiero's sitting in the garage with a totalled rear end.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">  There's around $3000-$4000 damage now, so I don't really care that much right at the time.  Thanks though.||||reg||1
